{"id": "unknown-2026-11-13-016", "date": "2026-11-13", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 46, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["hydrogen_policy"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Europe’s Hydrogen Strategy Should Begin With the Industrial Customer", "content": "<p>Europe is revising hydrogen policy. Industrial products and paying customers should determine hydrogen demand before new pipelines receive support.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://cleantechnica.com/2026/11/13/eu-hydrogen-strategy-industrial-demand-pipeline-cost/\">Europe’s Hydrogen Strategy Should Begin With the Industrial Customer</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://cleantechnica.com\">CleanTechnica</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "cleantechnica", "url": "https://cleantechnica.com/2026/11/13/eu-hydrogen-strategy-industrial-demand-pipeline-cost/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-11-13-017", "date": "2026-11-13", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 46, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["green_hydrogen_cost"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "The Hydrogen Stream: Uniper and VNG Produce first green hydrogen at 30 MW facility in Germany", "content": "<p>The hydrogen will be transported through a roughly 25 km former natural gas pipeline converted to carry hydrogen, with deliveries to a TotalEnergies' refinery scheduled to begin in 2027.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/11/13/the-hydrogen-stream-uniper-and-vng-produce-first-green-hydrogen-at-30-mw-facility-in-germany/\">The Hydrogen Stream: Uniper and VNG Produce first green hydrogen at 30 MW facility in Germany</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.co", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/11/13/the-hydrogen-stream-uniper-and-vng-produce-first-green-hydrogen-at-30-mw-facility-in-germany/", "type": "rss"}]}
